WEBVTT

00:01:26.493 --> 00:01:31.196
to talk about how hard it was
to follow that success with another book.

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:35.024
So Liz started a research project
where she explored the question:

00:01:35.048 --> 00:01:38.288
How do other societies
conceive of creativity?

00:01:38.312 --> 00:01:41.909
And once again, a very
personal quest for Liz,

00:01:41.933 --> 00:01:46.250
a desire to understand
how creativity happens,

00:01:46.274 --> 00:01:49.347
turned into inspiration
for millions of viewers

00:01:49.371 --> 00:01:52.671
and a book called "Big Magic."

00:01:52.695 --> 00:01:55.976
Liz has always been open
to new possibilities.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:00.527
Two summers ago, she announced
the amicable ending of her marriage